WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.009
Hi, there was a very famous book called
Seven Habits of Successful People and

00:00:05.009 --> 00:00:11.190
one of the important habits there was to
start out with the final goal in mind.

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:16.470
Now, your goal is to become a fluent
speaker of whatever language you're

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:20.369
learning, so you have to believe you can
do it. You have to have that vision, the

00:00:20.369 --> 00:00:26.160
vision of the enjoyment that you will
have once you can watch movies in your

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:30.900
favorite language, read books, talk to
people, travel to the country. So, every so

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.680
often again remind yourself of why
you're learning the language, and that

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:40.260
the goal is to all of a sudden find
yourself as a new person, someone who is

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:44.820
capable, and I've done it on a number of
occasions, you sometimes you think you'll

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:48.899
never get there but you got to keep that
goal fresh in your mind. You're going to

00:00:48.899 --> 00:00:56.250
become a fluent speaker of another
language. Keep your goal in mind. Good

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.460
luck!

